<h2>AI 2040: Plan A — Reactions and Critiques</h2>
<p>This installment follows the <a href="#!news-20260709-ai-2040-plan-a">AI 2040: Plan A overview</a> and gathers the <strong>support and criticism</strong> that appeared right after the 2026-07-09 release. What stands out is that the authors <strong>asked their sharpest critic (Richard Ngo) directly for a rebuttal and published it alongside the scenario</strong> — rather than suppressing the criticism, they ran it side by side. The summaries of the main points below are this wiki's editorial work; for the originals, follow each link.</p>

